# Exclude paths from the Docker build context (E06_S01).
#
# Closes IS2 from the E06_S01 critique. Without this file, every
# `docker build .` ships the entire working directory as the build
# context — including `.git/`, `var/arxmcp/` (potentially GBs of
# LanceDB blobs), and `.claude/` (project notes + state). Concrete
# benefits:
#
# 1. Build performance: the context tar is bounded.
# 2. Image-bloat defense in depth: a future `COPY . .` regression
#    would still not include `var/`.
# 3. Secret-leakage defense: `.git/objects` excluded means a rotated
#    secret stays out of every build context.

.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Project notes, milestone state, sub-agent outputs.
.claude/

# Runtime data (LanceDB blobs, downloaded papers, parser failures,
# embedding NPZs). Operators bind-mount their own data at run time.
var/

# Tests, docs, infra not needed for the runtime image.
tests/
docs/
infra/
# NOTE: shim/ is intentionally NOT excluded — it is a declared setuptools
# package (arxmcp-shim console-script) that the wheel build in
# docker/Dockerfile.server requires in the build context.

# Python build / cache artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.venv/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Editor / OS files.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
